  "content_id": "16136211",
  "title": "Ethereum Classic ETC Network Fees",
  "description": "Ethereum Classic (ETC) Network – Classic Chain, Simple Fees\nEthereum Classic is the original Ethereum chain, offering smart contract suppo...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ5YRSFAC4G3NYEF42YXSTR\">Ethereum Classic (ETC) Network – Classic Chain, Simple Fees</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Ethereum Classic is the original Ethereum chain, offering smart contract support with lower traffic and cheaper fees compared to Ethereum.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5YRSF7JX3RHNN1NKQC3B2\">How ETC Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas price (gwei) x Gas limit</b> (same model as Ethereum)</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Paid in <b>ETC</b> tokens.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge automatically estimates fees based on current ETC network congestion.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5YRSFH998JNYWN0YBVHNB\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced cost and speed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest option</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Manually set gas price and limit</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5YRSF106D6J4YWVWD2PBE\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically <b>$0.005 to $0.20 USD</b> per transaction, depending on network traffic.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ5YRSFA234F104ZPFT1XEA\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">ETC allows you to use smart contracts with Ethereum tech, but at much lower costs. Edge Wallet simplifies fee picking to keep your sends fast and affordable.</p>",
